      {
        "id": "repair-bench",
        "at": [
          1.8,
          6.3
        ],
        "title": "On the repair bench",
        "text": "A cream enamel housing rests on the worn worktop. Its hands have been laid beside it, with every screw kept in a separate tray. A pencilled sketch marks the joint Nell has been checking."
      },
      {
        "id": "parts-drawers",
        "at": [
          1.5,
          9.5
        ],
        "title": "The small-parts drawers",
        "text": "Washers, collars, springs. The brass label frames are polished where fingers have caught them. Two drawers have newer paper labels than the rest."
      },
      {
        "id": "stove",
        "at": [
          9.15,
          9.0
        ],
        "title": "By the stove",
        "text": "A low fire keeps the corner warm. The kettle is still warm, and someone has left a mug on the little table. The plaid throw has slipped down the chair."
      },
      {
        "id": "bread-cupboard",
        "at": [
          2.7,
          10.0
        ],
        "title": "The bread tin",
        "text": "A loaf sits under the raised lid, one end cut unevenly. The knife lies where it was put down; crumbs have gathered along the edge of the board."
